//  Created on 2026-10-27 for Darkride's upscaling.
//
//  Upscales the 3D view, drawn below the window's resolution (Render.viewportResolutionScale), to the window's size:
//  the edge-adaptive spatial upsampling (EASU) of AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1, the 32-bit version of
//  FsrEasuF() in ffx_fsr1.h, written out in plain GLSL 4.1 (no ffx_a.h). The source holds the tone-mapped picture
//  as the square root of its linear colour (gamma 2.0, the perceptual space EASU wants); the output stays in it, for
//  the sharpening pass (fsrRcas). The constants are FsrEasuCon()'s, worked out on the CPU (ToneMapAndResample).
